        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://token-plan-sgp.xiaomimimo.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'mimo-v2.5-pro', temperature: 0, response_format: { type: 'json_object' }, messages: [ { role: 'system', content: \"You are an expense-parsing assistant for a personal/business expense tracker. Given free-text describing an expense (may be informal, like a receipt summary or a quick note), extract structured data.  Respond with ONLY a single JSON object, no markdown fences, no commentary, matching exactly this shape: { \\\"date\\\": \\\"YYYY-MM-DD or null if not stated (will default to today)\\\", \\\"merchant\\\": \\\"string, the vendor/payee name\\\", \\\"amount\\\": number (numeric value only, no currency symbol), \\\"currency\\\": \\\"ISO 4217 3-letter code (e.g. USD, AUD, GBP), or null if genuinely ambiguous/not statable\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"one of: food, travel, transport, software, office, entertainment, groceries, utilities, health, other\\\", \\\"needs_review\\\": boolean (true if merchant, amount or currency could not be determined confidently; false if the input was clear and complete) }  Rules: - If no date is mentioned, set date to null (caller will default to today). Do not guess a date. - Never guess a currency if it is not stated or strongly implied (a bare currency symbol with no other context is ambiguous - if genuinely unclear, set currency to null and needs_review true). - Accuracy matters more than completeness - this is money data. - Resolve relative date words (today, yesterday, last Monday, etc.) into an absolute YYYY-MM-DD date using the reference date supplied in the user context. Do not leave a relative date as null.\" + ' Reference date (today) is ' + $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') + '.' }, { role: 'user', content: $json.body.text } ] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "gFrxmn3O73lcQA1u",
          "name": "Xiaomi Mimo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "build-expense-01",
      "name": "Build Expense",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $input.first().json;\nconst webhookBody = $('Webhook').first().json.body || {};\nconst rawText = webhookBody.text || '';\nconst source = webhookBody.source || 'web';\n\nlet parsed = {};\nlet parseError = null;\ntry {\n  const content = input.choices[0].message.content;\n  const cleaned = String(content).replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\n  parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n} catch (e) {\n  parseError = e.message;\n}\n\nconst today = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];\nconst date = (parsed.date && /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(parsed.date)) ? parsed.date : today;\nconst merchant = (parsed.merchant && String(parsed.merchant).trim()) || 'Unknown merchant';\nconst amount = (typeof parsed.amount === 'number' && isFinite(parsed.amount)) ? parsed.amount : 0;\nconst currency = (parsed.currency && /^[A-Z]{3}$/.test(parsed.currency)) ? parsed.currency : '';\nconst category = (parsed.category && String(parsed.category).trim()) || 'uncategorized';\n\nconst needsReview = Boolean(\n  parseError ||\n  parsed.needs_review === true ||\n  !parsed.merchant ||\n  typeof parsed.amount !== 'number' ||\n  !parsed.currency\n);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    submitted_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n    date,\n    merchant,\n    amount,\n    currency,\n    category,\n    source,\n    raw_text: rawText,\n    receipt_ref: '',\n    status: needsReview ? 'needs_review' : 'ok',\n    parsed_by: parseError ? 'mimo-v2.5-pro' : 'mimo-v2.5-pro',\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
